file tools/l/fleet-loop.sh the four verdicts as case arms; a limit holds LOOP_LIMIT_WAIT 300s up to 72 holds and counts no lap
file tools/fixtures/f/fleet_lap_verdict_control.sh twelve behaviors on planted transcripts, both refusals bitten by hand
file tools/f/fleet_lap_verdict_witness.rish the guard, rostered tier lap
file tools/f/fleet_rearm.sh the relaunch paste derived from the roster rather than a hand-spelled seat list
file tools/fixtures/f/fleet_rearm_paste_scan.sh empty_pastes gated at zero, shape-based so a ship added tomorrow arrives armed
file tools/f/fleet_rearm_witness.rish the leg that plants a seat the elder list never knew, plus the whole-card sweep
file construction/REDS.md %471 booked; %467 moved to %470 with the erratum naming my own push
