file construction/standing-equipment.kyri fleet_lap_verdict rostered tier lap
scope the fleet re-armed: one finished commit published, one tree brought current, one double-booking repaired, two faults fixed and guarded, one broken link repointed
status GREEN -- fleet_lap_verdict, fleet_rearm, fleet_roster, standing_equipment, reds_spine_derive, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_fold, readme_reach all green on metal
recommend check in (Keaton) -- patchouli's OAuth is expired and a login is the maintainer's own identity, which is a custody gate; every other ship is armed and running.
